  "content": "<div><!--StartFragment--><div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\">Potion Flask from \"The Alchemist\", the duergar 2nd-in-command of Cult of Demogorgon in Gracklstugh</div><div><br></div><div><b>Attack Action.&nbsp;</b>Throw flask up to 20ft. Explodes in 20ft radius. Creates the effects of the Stinking Cloud spell (counts as magic spell) that lasts 1 minute</div><div><br></div><div><!--StartFragment--><table id=\"pagecontent\" class=\"ve-w-100 ve-stats\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; background: rgb(34, 34, 34); width: 463.337px; font-family: Convergence, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.6px; table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(187, 187, 187);\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-stats__th-name ve-text-left ve-pb-0 \" colspan=\"6\" data-name=\"Stinking Cloud\" data-page=\"spells.html\" data-source=\"XPHB\" data-hash=\"stinking%20cloud_xphb\" style=\"padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 4px; position: relative; font-size: 1.8em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-variant: small-caps; font-weight: 500; padding-left: 0.2em !important; text-align: left !important;\"><div class=\"ve-split-v-end\" style=\"display: flex !important; justify-content: space-between !important; align-items: flex-end !important;\"><div class=\"ve-flex-v-center\" style=\"display: flex !important; align-items: center !important;\"><h1 class=\"ve-stats__h-name ve-copyable ve-m-0\" onmousedown=\"event.preventDefault()\" onclick=\"Renderer.utils._pHandleNameClick(this)\" style=\"font-size: unset; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: unset; color: rgb(210, 154, 56); cursor: copy !important;\">Stinking Cloud</h1></div><div class=\"ve-stats__wrp-h-source  ve-flex-v-baseline\" style=\"display: flex !important; align-items: baseline !important;\"><br></div></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><i>Level 3 Conjuration</i><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-pt-2\" style=\"padding-right: 4px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 4px; padding-top: 0.5rem !important; position: relative;\"><strike><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Casting Time:&nbsp;</span>Action</strike><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><strike><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Range:&nbsp;</span>90 feet</strike><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><strike><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Components:&nbsp;</span>V, S, M (a rotten egg)</strike><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-pb-2\" style=\"padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 4px; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 0.5rem !important; position: relative;\"><strike><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Duration:&nbsp;</span>Concentration, up to 1 minute</strike><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><div class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px;\">You create a 20-foot-radius Sphere of yellow, nauseating gas centered on a point within range. The cloud is Heavily Obscured. The cloud lingers in the air for the duration or until a strong wind (such as the one created by Gust of Wind) disperses it.</p><p>Each creature that starts its turn in the Sphere must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or have the Poisoned condition until the end of the current turn. While Poisoned in this way, the creature can't take an Action or a Bonus Action.</p></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table><!--EndFragment--></div><!--EndFragment--></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>",
